# Ad Studio — Kling Video API & German TTS
# Copy to ".env" (gitignored) and fill in. NEVER commit real keys.

# Your Kling API key. Without it, Ad Studio runs in simulation mode.
VITE_KLING_API_KEY=

# Optional: server-side proxy for Kling (recommended in production so the key
# never reaches the browser and to avoid CORS). Defaults to the live API.
# VITE_KLING_ENDPOINT=https://your-proxy.example.com/kling

# Optional: cloud TTS endpoint for broadcast-quality German narration.
# Without it, Ad Studio uses the browser's German voice for previews.
# VITE_TTS_ENDPOINT=https://your-proxy.example.com/tts
